<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπωπι-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strike</i> one <i>under the eye, give</i> him <i>a
				black eye</i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>have a black eye,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπωπιασμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					541
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1413a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.89
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>bruise, mortify,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				9.27
			</span></i>; also, <i>annoy greatly, wear out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				18.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.921f
			</span></i> (corr. Turnebus for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπιέζω</span>).</div>
